@startuml F1.1-D04-pull-to-refresh
title F1.1-D04 — Pull-to-refresh (mobile)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "MobileApp" as App
participant "TanStackQuery" as TQ
participant "DashboardBFF" as BFF
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> App: puxa a tela
note right of App: RefreshControl nativo

App -> TQ: invalidate dashboard
TQ -> BFF: GET /bff/dashboard/aluno
BFF -> Postgres: queries
Postgres --> BFF: dados
BFF --> TQ: 200
TQ --> App: atualiza UI
App --> Aluno: dashboard atualizado

@enduml
